.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-SHARE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-share \- Write a portable share of a graph, scope or project
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu share\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-group\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-construct\fR] [\fB\-\-shapes\fR] [\fB\-\-queries\fR] [\fB\-\-alignments\fR] [\fB\-\-parent\-share\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-destination\fR] [\fB\-\-pack\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-attest\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-attest\-issued\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-attest\-ttl\fR] [\fB\-\-attest\-agent\fR] [\fB\-\-attest\-session\fR] [\fB\-\-attest\-introducer\fR] [\fB\-\-attest\-nonce\fR] [\fB\-\-pointers\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-shapes\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-queries\fR] [\fB\-\-turtle\fR] [\fB\-\-attest\fR] [\fB\-\-project\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a portable share of a graph, scope or project
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Output directory for the share
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Explicit graph IRI for this operation
.TP
\fB\-\-group\-id\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Select facts belonging to this group
.TP
\fB\-\-construct\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
SPARQL CONSTRUCT query selecting the share
.TP
\fB\-\-shapes\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Shapes used for validation or packaging
.TP
\fB\-\-queries\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Stored queries to include
.TP
\fB\-\-alignments\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Reviewed SSSOM/RDF alignment file to carry
.TP
\fB\-\-parent\-share\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Parent share for a delta export
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Starting share or transaction for incremental output
.TP
\fB\-\-destination\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Publication destination evaluated by policy
.TP
\fB\-\-pack\-dir\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Existing pack directory to share
.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Actor recorded in operation provenance
.TP
\fB\-\-attest\-key\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Ed25519 attestation signing key file
.TP
\fB\-\-attest\-issued\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Attestation issue time as Unix seconds
.TP
\fB\-\-attest\-ttl\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Attestation lifetime in seconds
.TP
\fB\-\-attest\-agent\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Attested agent identifier
.TP
\fB\-\-attest\-session\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Attested session identifier
.TP
\fB\-\-attest\-introducer\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Attestation introducer identifier
.TP
\fB\-\-attest\-nonce\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Unique attestation nonce
.TP
\fB\-\-pointers\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
TOML file declaring external graph pointers
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-shapes\fR
Omit shapes from the share
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-queries\fR
Omit stored queries from the share
.TP
\fB\-\-turtle\fR
Include a human\-readable Turtle export
.TP
\fB\-\-attest\fR
Attach a signed agent attestation
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR
Export this repository\*(Aqs project graph to .quipu/graph
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-share\-diff(1)
Diff two packs by entity, or write a PR\-review report
.TP
quipu\-share\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
